      "id": "l1",
      "beatOrder": 1,
      "speakerId": "char_bone_reliquary_king",
      "text": {
        "key": "dlg_rk_rematch_l1",
        "value": "Ah. The boots. The attendants know your tread now — they begin carrying the ledgers down at the sound of it.",
        "lang": "en"
      },
      "humanEdited": false
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "beatOrder": 2,
      "speakerId": "char_bone_reliquary_king",
      "text": {
        "key": "dlg_rk_rematch_l2",
        "value": "I remember the arrows. The Continuance restores the flesh and keeps the lesson. A thorough clerk, that one.",
        "lang": "en"
      },
      "humanEdited": false
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "beatOrder": 3,
      "speakerId": "char_bone_reliquary_king",
      "text": {
        "key": "dlg_rk_rematch_l3",
        "value": "The law binds me still: watch my hands, and they will tell you where every blow falls. The door, as ever, is behind you.",
        "lang": "en"
      },
      "humanEdited": false
    }
  ],
